WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for t1-08-jealousy-release.mp3 — machine-transcribed on-device from the existing audio (SR-472). Not proofread.
NOTE Cues with ids phase-recognise/-regulate/-release/-rise mark where each step begins; js/saferise-poster.js reads them.

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:06.650
A sharp, uncomfortable feeling is active in your system right now.

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:11.080
One that most people try to hide or deny out of shame.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:25.440
Let us bring jealousy completely into the light.

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.470
With absolute compassion and no judgment.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:31.500
Using it as a direct doorway.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:33.100
To your hidden power.

00:00:46.410 --> 00:00:49.300
The biological body trips in a lamb first.

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:52.530
Sending a spike of threat through your veins.

00:00:53.060 --> 00:00:56.060
While the mine quickly builds a painful narrative.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:57.520
Of inadequacy

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.600
Living entirely in the gap between reaction and truth.

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:18.190
We will navigate four purposeful steps together.

phase-recognise
00:01:29.140 --> 00:01:32.840
First we recognise where this sensation burns physically.

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:34.820
It commonly manifests

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:37.600
As a sudden drop or not in the stomach,

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:40.500
A flush of heat rising through the chest

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:44.180
Or a cold, bitter contraction around the heart.

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:48.710
Assign this physiological reaction, one simple word.

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:51.250
Like exposed or contracted.

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:55.340
Notice the immediate space created by that single word.

00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:58.850
It separates you from the complex scenario.

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:00.450
The rivalries

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:02.920
And the mental movies playing in your head

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:15.350
The scenario can wait

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:18.640
But your nervous system needs your presence right now.

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:31.220
Beneath the sting lies a deep.

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:33.070
Unspoken desire.

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:35.470
That you have not yet allowed yourself.

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:37.740
To fully claim or pursue.

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:50.010
Let that desire exist

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:52.230
Without needing to solve or judge it.

phase-regulate
00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.980
Second, we regulate your breath.

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:57.260
To anchor you back in your center.

00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:00.290
Inhale deeply for six full counts

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:01.770
Feeling your lungs

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:04.840
And exhale slowly for six full counts.

00:03:15.850 --> 00:03:19.210
Focus your attention directly into the center of your chest.

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:35.730
This state generates a powerful impulse to search, check social media.

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:37.340
Or compare details

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:41.220
Gently choose to hold your body steady right now.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:43.440
Instead of acting on that urge.

00:03:56.230 --> 00:04:00.380
Let intrusive thoughts pass without granting them authority.

phase-release
00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:20.060
Third, we release the futile practice of comparison.

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:37.940
There are two separate occurrences happening.

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:39.950
There is the triggering event

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:45.690
And there is the internal measurement engine where you compare your inside
experience.

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:48.240
To their outside presentation.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:02.440
A contest designed to make you lose every single time.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.690
The jealousy can remain for a moment.

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:24.630
But gently lay down the compulsive ruler you are using to measure your worth.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:39.850
Extend genuine gratitude to your awareness and your heart.

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:56.000
For illuminating what has actually been stoking this internal fire.

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:18.340
The underlying concern that your unique value was somehow threatened or
unrecognized was intensely real to your system.

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:22.550
And keeping that hypervigilance running in the background

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:24.880
As being exhausting your spirit.

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:30.560
Thank you protective ego for trying to fight for your place in the world.

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:36.200
And acknowledge that you no longer need envy to guard your authentic worth.

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:50.730
Rest your breath directly inside that deep self-acceptance.

phase-rise
00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:05.140
Fourth, we rise into your authentic creative power.

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:12.700
Picture yourself sitting across the room, phone resting face down, holding a
valid human longing.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:16.260
Now imagine the integrated version of yourself

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:19.950
Who sees someone else's success not as a threat.

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:22.480
But as proof of what is possible.

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:30.030
A version who redirects every ounce of envious energy into building creating
or asking.

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:32.080
For what is genuinely yours

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:36.040
Step fully into that creative authority now.

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:48.000
Feel the shift from victimhood.

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:50.210
To order ship in your posture.

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:05.800
Choose one concrete action you will take today toward your own goals

00:08:06.390 --> 00:08:09.220
Completely independent of anyone else's part.

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:24.680
Take a deep, expansive breath in for six.

00:08:25.140 --> 00:08:26.760
And release it fully for six.

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:40.630
Feel the floor firm beneath your feet.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.400
Gently move your fingers and toes.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:47.220
Open your eyes and return to this practice.

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:50.370
Whenever you need to turn envy.

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:52.970
Into self-realization
